<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Devil Daggers Shotgun Tech</Major>
    <Description>Macro for fastest possible shotgun blasts. Timings have been tuned for maximum speed and reliability. Includes looping of Mouse 1 hold to maximise recharge. No need to initiate tech, just hold macro key and it starts the cycle for you.

NOTE: Does not work if started during dagger upgrade "slo-mo", as timings become different. Will fire short spurts of single daggers. If this occurs, release macro key, wait 0.4 seconds, and press macro again.</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 64 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 96 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 310 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 32 ms
GoWhile 5 1000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Devil Daggers</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>